The residual enters (7.57) through two consequences of the relation (7.10): $$\begin{equation}
 \mathbb PF_\alpha^{\mathrm a}\in\mathcal H_{\mathrm{div}}^\Gamma\quad(\alpha\in\mathcal K),\qquad
